294
00:14:42,740 --> 00:14:44,160
We'll go there once this is over.

295
00:14:44,420 --> 00:14:45,760
Just hang in there a little longer.

296
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:51,020
Maximum allowed depth plus 120.

297
00:14:53,020 --> 00:14:55,720
Ava Unit 2 has lost its progressive knife.

298
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,480
Maximum allowed depth plus 200.

299
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:59,940
Captain Katsuragi, you've got to stop this.

300
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:02,180
Have you forgotten that there's a human being in there?

301
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:05,040
