327
00:16:14,580 --> 00:16:16,900
The only thing we have to fear is fear itself.

328
00:16:17,140 --> 00:16:18,160
This was easy.

329
00:16:19,060 --> 00:16:21,380
Man, this isn't an entry plug suit.

330
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,820
It's a sauna bath.

331
00:16:23,540 --> 00:16:26,340
Oh, I just want to go and take a cold shower.

332
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:29,380
Sounds like the tension let loose all at once.

333
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:30,180
Yeah.

334
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:32,080
Were you scared about this operation?

335
